<!-- SPECKIT START -->
For additional context about technologies to be used, project structure,
shell commands, and other important information, read the current plan
at `specs/003-fix-text-likes-ui/plan.md`.

Key facts:
- Stack: React 18 + Vite + TypeScript (client), Node.js + Express + Socket.io + Prisma + TypeScript (server)
- Database: MS SQL Server via Prisma ORM
- Structure: `client/` (SPA) and `server/` (API + real-time) at repo root
- Real-time: Socket.io `global-feed` room; only like/reply counts are live
- Session: express-session (in-memory), active userId in session
- Images: Multer → `server/uploads/` served as static
- No auth — prototype trust model; ownership enforced by UI only
- Feed cache MUST be keyed by session user id (`["feed", userId]`)
- See `specs/003-fix-text-likes-ui/` for spec, research, data-model, contracts, quickstart
